  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">A shift that increases the governing coalition's legislative margin directly eases appropriations and authorization votes, enabling larger and faster congressional-approved weapons and funding packages to flow to Ukraine.</data>
