  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Strong alignment between the executive and legislature accelerates interagency permitting, utility coordination and access to federal sites/permits, reducing delay and increasing the rate of data‑center groundbreakings and starts.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
