  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Stronger executive‑legislative policy alignment reduces mixed messaging and domestic pressure for compromise, emboldening Kyiv and its backers to adopt firmer negotiating positions and reducing willingness to make concessions.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_political_realignment</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
