<edge source="us_political_realignment::policy_clarity" target="ai_buildout_and_bust::compute_capacity_utiliza" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Clear, credible multi‑year government procurement commitments, cloud credits or signal‑backed demand forecasts enable firms and cloud providers to schedule workloads and purchase capacity, raising utilization of existing AI compute.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_political_realignment</data>
  <data key="d39">ai_buildout_and_bust</data>
</edge>
<edge source="us_political_realignment::policy_clarity" target="iran_gulf_conflict::negotiation_intensity" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Clear, credible US policy commitments (e.g., defined concessions or security guarantees) reduce counterpart uncertainty and create diplomatic leverage, prompting greater momentum, resourcing and participation in mediated talks involving Iran and Gulf actors.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_political_realignment</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_gulf_conflict</data>
</edge>
<edge source="us_political_realignment::policy_clarity" target="russia_ukraine_war::multinational_coop" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Clear, credible US policy commitments lower coordination costs and uncertainty for partners, allowing allied governments and institutions to synchronize arms deliveries, sanctions, and diplomatic steps more efficiently.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_political_realignment</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
<edge source="us_political_realignment::policy_clarity" target="tech_trade_and_chip_riva::crossborder_capital_flow" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Clear, credible policy commitments reduce perceived political and regulatory risk and lower country risk premia, encouraging multinational firms and financiers to commit cross‑border capital to tech projects and deals.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_political_realignment</data>
  <data key="d39">tech_trade_and_chip_riva</data>
</edge>
