  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A marked escalation in Gulf conflict intensity triggers a rally‑round‑the‑flag dynamic and security-focused congressional votes, increasing short-term policy and agenda alignment between the executive and a majority of legislators on military and sanction measures.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_gulf_conflict</data>
