<edge source="iran_gulf_conflict::shipping_disruption_rate" target="ai_buildout_and_bust::data_center_construction" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher rates of shipping disruption physically delay delivery of racks, GPUs, power gear and other specialized components, causing data‑center groundbreakings, outfitting and completions to be postponed or cancelled.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_gulf_conflict</data>
  <data key="d39">ai_buildout_and_bust</data>
</edge>
<edge source="iran_gulf_conflict::shipping_disruption_rate" target="russia_ukraine_war::military_aid_flow" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Increased disruptions to Gulf shipping raise transit times, insurance and rerouting costs for commercial and military cargoes, causing delays, lower throughput or cancellation of arms shipments from manufacturers in Asia/MENA to Europe and thereby reducing effective aid flow to Ukraine.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_gulf_conflict</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
<edge source="iran_gulf_conflict::shipping_disruption_rate" target="tech_trade_and_chip_riva::chip_production_capacity" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Increased attacks, inspections or route closures delay or block delivery of critical inputs (wafer substrates, gases, specialty chemicals, equipment), forcing fabs to slow or halt runs and thereby reducing effective semiconductor output.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_gulf_conflict</data>
  <data key="d39">tech_trade_and_chip_riva</data>
</edge>
<edge source="iran_gulf_conflict::shipping_disruption_rate" target="tech_trade_and_chip_riva::crossborder_capital_flow" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Frequent shipping incidents raise logistics risk premiums and insurance costs and create uncertain delivery schedules, which directly discourage cross‑border investment and M&amp;A in geographically exposed tech supply‑chain assets.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_gulf_conflict</data>
  <data key="d39">tech_trade_and_chip_riva</data>
</edge>
