  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.55</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained increases in shipping disruptions impose visible economic costs on coastal and supply-chain-dependent districts, prompting voters and interest groups to punish incumbent parties in special or upcoming elections and thereby reducing the governing coalition's legislative margin.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_gulf_conflict</data>
