  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A rapid inflow of AI‑sector capital spurs legislators and state/federal tax authorities to propose ad hoc incentives, special levies or reinterpretations of tax treatment for AI investment, raising perceived volatility and unpredictability of tax policy for affected firms.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">ai_buildout_and_bust</data>
  <data key="d39">us_political_realignment</data>
