  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">A sudden uptick in data‑center ground‑breaks exposes inconsistencies across municipal, state and federal permitting and incentive rules and prompts stopgap guidance, which lowers the clarity and credibility of policymakers' commitments for firms and local governments.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">ai_buildout_and_bust</data>
