  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Tighter and more pervasive AI permitting and compliance requirements increase investor uncertainty and transaction costs, causing foreign investors to pull back or reprice cross‑border investments into tech.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
