  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">Intensifying domestic regulatory scrutiny of AI spurs policymakers to broaden and tighten outbound controls on hardware, software and data flows deemed sensitive to national security.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">ai_buildout_and_bust</data>
