  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Escalation in great‑power tech rivalry drives increased naval presence, intelligence operations and permissive conditions for proxies, which in turn produces more boarding, harassment and attacks on commercial vessels transiting the Gulf.</data>
