  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Escalating strategic rivalry in the technology domain sharpens threat perceptions among Western and like‑minded states, prompting them to accelerate and deepen coordinated sanctions, information‑sharing and joint assistance policies toward Russia and Ukraine.</data>
